#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
msgstr "InstUI, povsod"

#: index.md:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "En razrešen model tokenov, preoblikovan v slogovne liste, vezave za ogrodja, nativen kodo in pakete za oblikovalska orodja."

#: index.md:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Začetek"

#: index.md:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The package map"
msgstr "Zemljevid paketov"

#: index.md:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Referenca API"

#: index.md:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "Referenca za CSS"

#: index.md:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "En sam vir resnice"

#: index.md:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
msgstr "Vsak paket uporablja isti razrešeni token IR. Spremenite token v izvoru in sprememba se enako prenese v CSS, SCSS, nativen kodo in Figma."

#: index.md:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Uporabite najmanjši paket"

#: index.md:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install just @pantoken/css for a stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks and icons, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Namestite le @pantoken/css za slogovno datoteko, @pantoken/react za hooke in ikone, ali prednastavitev bundlerja za Tailwind, Panda ali MUI."

#: index.md:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Generirajte za katero koli platformo"

#: index.md:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
msgstr "Zaženite `pantoken generate`, da izvozite Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress in še več. Isti tokeni, v idiomu vsakega ekosistema."

#: index.md:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "No upstream coupling"
msgstr "Brez vezave na upstream"

#: index.md:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
msgstr "Tokeni so vključeni kot vendorirana statična JSON datoteka, zato `npm i` nikoli ne posega po izvoru, ki je omejen na GitHub. Objavljivo, s semver različicami, prijazno za delo brez povezave."
